\section{Unfinished Business}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Liffey B representative vacancy: Position remains unfilled; President developing a candidate list (with input
from Weezie and Liz); no appointment made.
\item Annual awards (Legacy Award; Extraordinary Service Award): Handout distributed; nominations requested;
no nominations made; nominations due next month.
\item Operational structure memo/document: Clarifications pending (Rich Compton to confer with David Denton);
distribution to Council pending.
\item Bylaws amendment: Secretary George Wright moved to amend the bylaws as proposed in the item introduced last
month and appearing in the minutes of July 9. President Luke Yackley seconded.  There was no discussion.
Voice vote taken; motion was approved unanimously.
\end{enumerate}

\section{New Business}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Bistro dress code/signage concern: Referred informally to the Executive Director to raise with the Dining
Committee; pending follow-up.
\end{enumerate}

\section{Adjournment}
Chair Luke Yackley adjourned the meeting at 3:40 p.m.

